    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257260/extras/4e074f6cce69df38439088d82cb4efee.poster.avif?t=1730243343\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257260/extras/4e074f6cce69df38439088d82cb4efee.webm?t=1730243343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257260/extras/4e074f6cce69df38439088d82cb4efee.mp4?t=1730243343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Overview</strong><br><br>Can you survive four long nights in the Aim Trainer Asylum? Play through visually rich aim training levels while avoiding monsters of the night... or simple figments of your imagination.<br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired? Unwell? Seeing things? Encounter different nightmare creatures in your dreams testing your aim training skills against them. Featuring 6 different difficulty modes, both casual and competitive players can find success in the Asylum.\u00a0Survive all nights in Aim Trainer Asylum featuring dark fantasy visuals. Like a traditional Aim Trainer, there will be varying familiar aim training scenarios you can play through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror Content</strong>- Body parts, blood, fictional gore characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Loud noises, scary music, jump scares, mild flashing lights </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Depiction of fictional insanity, asylum setting<br><br><strong>Credits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to... YOU :)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257260/extras/4e074f6cce69df38439088d82cb4efee.poster.avif?t=1730243343\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257260/extras/4e074f6cce69df38439088d82cb4efee.webm?t=1730243343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257260/extras/4e074f6cce69df38439088d82cb4efee.mp4?t=1730243343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Overview</strong><br><br>Can you survive four long nights in the Aim Trainer Asylum? Play through visually rich aim training levels while avoiding monsters of the night... or simple figments of your imagination.<br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired? Unwell? Seeing things? Encounter different nightmare creatures in your dreams testing your aim training skills against them. Featuring 6 different difficulty modes, both casual and competitive players can find success in the Asylum.\u00a0Survive all nights in Aim Trainer Asylum featuring dark fantasy visuals. Like a traditional Aim Trainer, there will be varying familiar aim training scenarios you can play through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horror Content</strong>- Body parts, blood, fictional gore characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Loud noises, scary music, jump scares, mild flashing lights </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Depiction of fictional insanity, asylum setting<br><br><strong>Credits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to... YOU :)</p>",
